I wrote this essay about a month ago:

*Thoughts on an Official Dictionary*
<https://mw-live.lojban.org/papri/User:Maik/Thoughts_on_an_Official_Dictionary>

Since then, I have begun work on a MediaWiki-based multilingual dictionary
for Lojban. If you would like to see the progress and keep up on
developments, I suggest you join the LFK discussion channel. You can
find instructions
on how to join here <https://mw-live.lojban.org/papri/LFK>.

I would be pleased to receive any comments you might have. You can place
feedback on the Lojban wiki discussion page
<https://mw-live.lojban.org/papri/User_talk:Maik/Thoughts_on_an_Official_Dictionary>,
or write a comment here on Reddit
<https://www.reddit.com/r/lojban/comments/fbn50f/thoughts_on_an_official_dictionary/>,
or send it by email (on this Lojban list or privately as you like).

-Mike

